{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicAerchemistryColumn",
    "description": "The MOSAIC column processes WRF-Chem chem_opt = 170 applies after gas-particle transfer -- new-particle formation, coagulation and aerosol dry deposition -- over the whole column (59 levels x 8 sections), summed into one instantaneous tendency per quantity, section and level. Section moving is not here (branch mosaic/movesect, pending EarthSciDiscretizations PR #54), nor is MOSAIC's gas-particle transfer (couplings/mosaic_column.esm).\n\nWHAT IS MOUNTED. CoagEntry (coagulation_entry_state.esm on [lev, bin]): mosaic_coag_1clm's per-bin preparation of the MOSAIC state -- the carried dry diagnostics checked and recomputed, the number conformed into the section, dry and wet diameters, wet density. CoagKernel (coagulation_kernel.esm, 0-D): the Fuchs pair kernel, LIFTED pointwise over every pair of sections of every cell ([lev, bin, bin2]). CoagAssembly (coagulation_assembly.esm on [lev, bin] and twelve composition columns): coagsolv's splitting tables and the production and loss sums as rates. Nucleation (nucleation_wexler.esm, 0-D, lifted over the levels): the corrected (B20) Wexler binary scheme. DryDeposition (dry_deposition_velocity.esm, 0-D, lifted over the lowest layer's sections). Column holds the state and the sums.\n\nTHE TENDENCIES. Coagulation is a rate at the input distribution: its number tendency (per cm^3 of air) over the molar air density is the number mixing ratio's, and its composition columns are already mixing ratios. Nucleation is an increment per call that is the same whatever sub-step it is applied over (B20 fixed); it joins as increment/dt_nuc, the WSM6 rule of CLAUDE.md, with dt_nuc = dtchem a PARAMETER of the tendency prescribed in the document, so this term does not converge as an integrator's step shrinks -- it is the operator-split scheme's own. New particles go into section 1 (isize_nuc = 1), as sulfate and ammonium, and the vapour leaves H2SO4 and NH3. Dry deposition is the flux v_d X out of the lowest layer over its thickness dz1, vertmx's lower-boundary term with the mixing off (as couplings/cbmz_column.esm writes Wesely's); mosaic_drydep_1clm's velocity applies to every quantity of the section, number, components and both waters, as WRF assigns ddvel. The thirteenth coagulation column, the dry volume, only refreshes the aqvoldry_sub diagnostic and is not carried.\n\nONE STATE. WRF runs these stages in sequence, each from the state the previous one left, so a summed instantaneous tendency is compared against each process's tendency at ONE state: MOSAIC's nucleation-entry state rsub_therm of the step. Coagulation's reference is a real64 replay with nucleation skipped (kernels/mosaic_subproc_driver, ESM_SKIP_NEWNUC=1, WRF fork earthsciml-instrumented-chem170); at step 1 its section-1 rate there differs from the in-model one (taken after nucleation filled section 1) by a factor of 13, which is why the one state matters. Dry deposition is evaluated on that state's lowest layer with u*, the aerodynamic resistance and dz1 of the dry-deposition call numbered s (model step s + 2: those hooks count from the third step), a constructed state whose reference is a real64 replay at exactly those inputs. Tests: tools/fill_mosaic_aerchem_column_tests.py, notes data/eqwefic/notes/mosaic_aerchem_column.md.\n\nMEASURED. Every assertion is real64 against real64, rel 1e-9 with an absolute floor of 1e-9 of the largest term entering it; the worst residual over the four steps sits between 3e-10 and 1e-9 of that scale (coagsolv sums its sparse pair lists in another order, as coagulation_assembly.esm measured), and every deposition velocity agrees to 1e-13 once mosaic_drydep_parameters' piover6 carries MOSAIC's pi = 3.14159265. Mutation-checked: dropping nucleation fails 204 assertions, deposition 357, coagulation's number term 1722 and its composition terms 16992; pressure 0.1% off 22610, the water/hysteresis-water columns swapped 3616, dz1 1e-4 off 352, the nucleation RH 0.1% off 408, deposition reading the number for the water 389, the kernel's second partner reading the first's diameter 23858.\n\nNOT HERE. MOSAIC's gas-particle transfer, its thermodynamics and section moving; the coupling to the CBM-Z gas column (couplings/cbmz_column.esm) -- this document's H2SO4 and NH3 tendencies and the host mapping (components/aerosol/mosaic/mosaic_host_mapping.esm, mapaer_tofrom_host) are the pieces it would join through; and vertical mixing.",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "wrf-chem",
      "mosaic",
      "aerosol",
      "coagulation",
      "nucleation",
      "dry-deposition",
      "column",
      "coupling"
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 59,
      "description": "Grid cells of the column (59 in the chem_opt = 170 run)."
    },
    "NBIN": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 8,
      "description": "MOSAIC size sections (8)."
    },
    "NCOMP": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 10,
      "description": "Components per section."
    },
    "NQ": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 12,
      "description": "Composition columns carried through coagulation: NCOMP components, the hysteresis water and the water."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NLEV"
    },
    "bin": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "bin2": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "comp": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NCOMP"
    },
    "cq": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NQ"
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "CoagEntry": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/coagulation_entry_state.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN",
        "NCOMP": "NCOMP"
      }
    },
    "CoagKernel": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/coagulation_kernel.esm"
    },
    "CoagAssembly": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/coagulation_assembly.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN",
        "NQ": "NQ"
      }
    },
    "Nucleation": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/nucleation_wexler.esm"
    },
    "DryDeposition": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/dry_deposition_velocity.esm"
    },
    "Column": {
      "variables": {
        "temp": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 290.0,
          "description": "Air temperature rsub(ktemp)."
        },
        "ptot": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "dyn/cm^2",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 1000000.0,
          "description": "Air pressure ptotclm."
        },
        "cair": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 4e-05,
          "description": "Molar air density cairclm."
        },
        "rh": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 0.5,
          "description": "Relative humidity relhumclm."
        },
        "q_h2so4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 1e-11,
          "description": "Gas-phase H2SO4 rsub(kh2so4)."
        },
        "q_nh3": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 1e-11,
          "description": "Gas-phase NH3 rsub(knh3)."
        },
        "n": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1000000.0,
          "description": "Number mixing ratio of each section rsub(numptr_aer)."
        },
        "r": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "comp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Component mixing ratios rsub(massptr_aer), MOSAIC's order so4, no3, cl, co3, nh4, na, ca, oin, oc, bc."
        },
        "water": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Aerosol water rsub(waterptr_aer)."
        },
        "hysw": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Hysteresis water rsub(hyswptr_aer)."
        },
        "mass_in": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-10,
          "description": "Carried dry mass aqmassdry_sub."
        },
        "vol_in": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 5e-11,
          "description": "Carried dry volume aqvoldry_sub."
        },
        "rho_in": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 2.0,
          "description": "Carried dry density adrydens_sub."
        },
        "mw": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/mol",
          "shape": [
            "comp"
          ],
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Component molar masses mw_aer."
        },
        "dens": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "comp"
          ],
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Component densities dens_aer."
        },
        "v_lo": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Section lower single-particle volume volumlo_sect."
        },
        "v_hi": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Section upper volume volumhi_sect."
        },
        "v_cen": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Section centre volume volumcen_sect."
        },
        "d_lo": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm",
          "shape": [
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Section lower diameter dlo_sect."
        },
        "d_hi": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm",
          "shape": [
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Section upper diameter dhi_sect."
        },
        "d_cen": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm",
          "shape": [
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Section centre diameter dcen_sect."
        },
        "ustar": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.1,
          "description": "Friction velocity ust handed to mosaic_drydep_driver."
        },
        "aer_res": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "s/m",
          "default": 100.0,
          "description": "Aerodynamic resistance aer_res handed to mosaic_drydep_driver."
        },
        "dz1": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 50.0,
          "description": "Thickness of the lowest layer, dz8w(1): the layer the deposition flux leaves through."
        },
        "dt_nuc": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "s",
          "default": 60.0,
          "description": "The sub-step MOSAIC applies its nucleation increment over (dtchem): a PARAMETER of the nucleation tendency, not the integrator's step (CLAUDE.md, the WSM6 rule). The increment is dt-independent (B20 fixed), so the tendency is increment/dt_nuc."
        },
        "mw_water_aer": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/mol",
          "default": 18.016,
          "description": "mw_water_aer, the molar mass of aerosol water mosaic_drydep_1clm uses."
        },
        "c_so4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1,
          "description": "Position of sulfate among the components (lptr_so4_aer)."
        },
        "c_nh4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 5,
          "description": "Position of ammonium among the components (lptr_nh4_aer)."
        },
        "b_nuc": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1,
          "description": "The section new particles are placed in (isize_nuc = 1: volumlo_sect(1) is their volume)."
        },
        "dp_wet_e": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-06,
          "description": "Coagulation entry wet diameter, from CoagEntry."
