      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "aerchem_s1",
          "description": "The whole chem_opt = 170 column (59 levels x 8 sections), model step 1, at MOSAIC's nucleation-entry state rsub_therm (after gas-particle transfer and water uptake) of dumps/chem170_wrf esm_dump_mosaic_1; nucleation fires at 46 of 59 levels. Dry deposition reads u* = 0.0257 m/s, aerodynamic resistance 4727 s/m and dz1 = 63.232 m from the dry-deposition and vertmx calls numbered 1 (model step 3): a constructed state, whose reference is a replay at exactly these inputs. Expected values: real64 replays of WRF's own routines at this one state (data/eqwefic/chem170_scm/aerchem64: nuc_1, coag_1 with nucleation skipped so coagulation sees rsub_therm, dd_1), summed as the coupling sums them; rel 1e-9 with an absolute floor of 1e-9 of the largest term entering each assertion. Filled by tools/fill_mosaic_aerchem_column_tests.py.",
